FUNCTIONS OF INTER-AGENCY TASK FORCE (IATF)
The Task force shall have the following functons:
a) Formulate an IPv6 roadmap;
b) Initiate and manage IPv6 data collection;
c) Develop baseline and metrics for measuring IPv6 usage and benefits in
the country;
d) Provide periodic reports to the President through the Chairman of CICT
regarding the activities of the Task Force
